Okay, here it is again:

	To convert an altar, simply sacrifice at it.  MAKE SURE your luck
is not negative, or your might end up converting yourself instead!
	It's generally safe if you haven't done anything recently to
anger your god.  Conversion may take a few tries, just keep on
sacrificing until the newly-consecrated altar glows.

